# tinkr
===
 A new way to run code. Run a snippet in any project, container or ssh connection; read the value as a tree, table, graph or markup; see the queries it sent; dry-run a write in a transaction or a sandbox; stop a run; read your app's logs in their own window, filtered by level and time; drive it from your MCP client..
